    "title": "Baseball Puts on Offensive Show; Tops Stony Brook 14-8 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By BVM Sportsdesk, ,\n1 days ago Siena Baseball showcased a powerful offensive performance with a 14-8 win over Stony Brook, demonstrating their hitting prowess with 17 total hits. The Saints built a strong lead thanks to a seven-run second inning and maintained control throughout the game despite a late rally from the Seawolves. With this victory, Siena improved to 6-8, winning six of their last seven games, while Stony Brook fell to 2-12. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
